## Direct data input

The actual selected train/dev/test/OOD/cal files were derived directly from:

  Zefan Cai, Open-Jev v1.1 data
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/ZefanCai/Open-Jev-v1.1
  configuration: community-hard-mix-v2-redistributable
  data terms: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ZefanCai/Open-Jev-v1.1/blob/main/LICENSE-DATA.md
  third-party notices: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ZefanCai/Open-Jev-v1.1/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

This is the published 326,619-record projection, not the complete 328,672-record
parent mixture or the exact full dataset used for an upstream model's training.
It omits 2,053 Wikispeedia records; none was restored into our selected splits.
The 23,718 released member identities all matched that cached public projection.
Some public source names contain "control" or "workflow"; that does not make them
additional project-private tasks. No private task body is published here.

