Historical artifacts are preserved byte-for-byte as found. Their original archival hashes
and already-redacted shipped hashes are different and both recorded. The new
member/origin/identity indices are bookkeeping, not compatibility claims: no acceptance is
implied for an arbitrary build or measurement. These documentation statements do not
constitute tests of loader enforcement, clean-upstream patch application/build, complete
application installation, or exact-pair numerical compatibility.
